 "caption": "Far from VWAP? That's not a signal. 📏\n\nOn a trend day price can ride the +1 and +2 standard deviation bands for hours, and every blind fade gets run over. The edge appears when price makes a higher high at +2 SD while cumulative delta prints a lower high: buyers are no longer lifting offers, so the move is running on fumes.\n\n1️⃣ Wait for the +2 SD band\n2️⃣ Require a CVD divergence\n3️⃣ Target VWAP, not the moon\n\nFollow @institutionalmetatrading for daily order flow rules.\n\nEducational content. Not financial advice.\n\n#vwap #orderflow #cumulativedelta #volumeanalysis #meanreversion #daytrading #futurestrading #dax"
